WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:31.583
This verse is the first

2
00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:35.375
of the Chatur-shloki Bhagavad Gita –

3
00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:38.666
that form the very essence
of Lord Krishna's teachings.

4
00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:42.708
In this verse, Lord Krishna presents Himself

5
00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:43.708
as the supreme source

6
00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:47.458
of both the material and spiritual worlds.

7
00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:49.833
Recognising this truth,

8
00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:53.208
the wise naturally worship Him

9
00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:55.375
with complete devotion.

10
00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:57.333
This verse lays the foundation

11
00:00:57.333 --> 00:01:00.125
for understanding Lord Krishna's supreme role

12
00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:01.666
in creation, sustenance,

13
00:01:01.666 --> 00:01:05.125
and the ultimate purpose of life.

14
00:01:09.916 --> 00:01:13.208
Lord Krishna declares,

15
00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:15.625
'I am the source of all

16
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:18.750
spiritual and material worlds.

17
00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:22.833
Everything emanates from Me.'

18
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:26.125
This statement establishes Lord Krishna

19
00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:27.833
as Svayam Bhagavan –

20
00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:31.625
the original Supreme Person.

21
00:01:31.625 --> 00:01:33.458
Not just creation,

22
00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:37.041
but the operation and
maintenance of the universe

23
00:01:37.041 --> 00:01:40.208
also depend directly on Him.

24
00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:43.458
The phrase 'aham sarvasya prabhavo'

25
00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:44.958
presents Lord Krishna as the origin

26
00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:47.875
of everything in creation,

27
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:52.250
revealing His unique and unparalleled position.

28
00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.791
Unlike a creator who remains
distant from creation,

29
00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:59.916
Lord Krishna is actively involved

30
00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:03.625
in every aspect of existence –

31
00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:05.958
sustaining all

32
00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:08.833
and enabling all to grow.

33
00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:11.500
'Mattah sarvam pravartate'

34
00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:14.666
shows that not only do all powers

35
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:17.875
and elements arise from Lord Krishna,

36
00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:22.583
they all continue to function under His will.

37
00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:24.958
When someone understands this truth,

38
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:27.416
what transformative effect

39
00:02:27.416 --> 00:02:29.750
does it have on their life?

40
00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.833
Lord Krishna describes it –

41
00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:36.125
'Those who are truly wise, knowing this fully,

42
00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.333
engage in My devotion

43
00:02:38.333 --> 00:02:41.916
and worship Me with their whole heart.'

44
00:02:41.916 --> 00:02:44.625
This understanding brings a shift –

45
00:02:44.625 --> 00:02:48.583
from intellectual knowledge
to wholehearted devotion.

46
00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:51.875
Lord Krishna uses the word 'budhah'

47
00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:53.458
for those who are

48
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:55.833
truly wise –

49
00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:58.833
not through mere intellectual argument,

50
00:02:58.833 --> 00:03:01.250
but those who have truly

51
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.583
realised the supreme truth.

52
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:07.166
These enlightened souls engage

53
00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:10.083
in 'bhajante mam' –

54
00:03:10.083 --> 00:03:12.458
not as a ritual or

55
00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.291
mechanical religious activity,

56
00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:18.333
but with deep feeling and surrender.

57
00:03:18.333 --> 00:03:19.416
'Bhava-samanvitah'.

58
00:03:19.416 --> 00:03:21.541
This phrase emphasises worship

59
00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:25.541
done with love and reverence.

60
00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:28.750
It is not a mere outward religious act,

61
00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:32.708
but an expression of pure devotion.

62
00:03:32.708 --> 00:03:35.750
This verse sheds light on
the transformative power

63
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.833
of knowing Lord Krishna

64
00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:40.458
as the supreme truth.

65
00:03:40.458 --> 00:03:44.125
Once this truth is absorbed,

66
00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:45.208
a person's life

67
00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:48.500
aligns with devotion –

68
00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:51.833
begins to connect with devotion.

69
00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:56.666
Every action becomes an
offering to Lord Krishna.

70
00:03:56.666 --> 00:03:58.041
In the coming verses,

71
00:03:58.041 --> 00:04:03.208
Lord Krishna will reveal even
deeper aspects of this knowledge.

72
00:04:07.916 --> 00:04:09.708
Look,

73
00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:15.000
within you, two powers reside –

74
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.500
the heart

75
00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.833
and the intellect.

76
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:21.458
The beautiful harmony of these two

77
00:04:21.458 --> 00:04:24.583
is the very essence of life.

78
00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:28.125
In life, a balance between intellect and feeling

79
00:04:28.125 --> 00:04:30.583
is deeply necessary.

80
00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:33.500
Those who are truly wise,

81
00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:38.500
who recognise Me as the source of everything,

82
00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:42.750
naturally worship Me

83
00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:47.125
with a loving heart.

84
00:04:47.125 --> 00:04:50.000
Have you ever noticed

85
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.833
how dry a life becomes

86
00:04:52.833 --> 00:04:56.833
when it is only full of thinking?

87
00:04:56.833 --> 00:04:59.750
And how many mistakes are made

88
00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.750
when swept away by emotion alone?

89
00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:07.958
Just as a musical instrument

90
00:05:07.958 --> 00:05:11.875
produces beautiful music only
when its strings are balanced,

91
00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:16.375
in the same way, the balance
of your heart and mind

92
00:05:16.375 --> 00:05:20.000
gives life its sweetness.

93
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:25.125
When making a decision, ask your mind –

94
00:05:25.125 --> 00:05:27.625
'Is this right?'

95
00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:30.458
And ask your heart –

96
00:05:30.458 --> 00:05:32.958
'Is this good?'

97
00:05:32.958 --> 00:05:34.708
Imagine.

98
00:05:34.708 --> 00:05:39.375
You are choosing a new direction in life.

99
00:05:39.375 --> 00:05:42.166
Your intellect tells you

100
00:05:42.166 --> 00:05:44.250
this path is safe.

101
00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:47.125
But your heart says,

102
00:05:47.125 --> 00:05:48.541
does this path

103
00:05:48.541 --> 00:05:52.208
match your inner nature?

104
00:05:52.208 --> 00:05:55.541
When you speak with a friend,

105
00:05:55.541 --> 00:05:58.041
think wisely

106
00:05:58.041 --> 00:06:01.958
about what to say, and think with love

107
00:06:01.958 --> 00:06:06.416
about how to say it. This is the balance.

108
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:08.333
Remember –

109
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:11.583
intellect is your horse,

110
00:06:11.583 --> 00:06:15.916
and love is the reins that guide it.

111
00:06:15.916 --> 00:06:19.708
Mastering both together moves you

112
00:06:19.708 --> 00:06:23.208
toward divine balance like Mine.

113
00:06:23.208 --> 00:06:25.500
This is the joy of life.

114
00:06:30.333 --> 00:06:32.375
That puja thali,

115
00:06:32.375 --> 00:06:38.333
that lamp, that sandalwood.

116
00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:41.666
Have you ever thought

117
00:06:41.666 --> 00:06:42.541
about

118
00:06:42.541 --> 00:06:44.750
the deep meaning hidden

119
00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.791
in each of these,

120
00:06:47.791 --> 00:06:49.791
Or do you simply

121
00:06:49.791 --> 00:06:53.125
go through them as part of a daily routine?

122
00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:55.541
Look,

123
00:06:55.541 --> 00:06:57.666
knowing Me

124
00:06:57.666 --> 00:07:00.166
is not just book knowledge

125
00:07:00.166 --> 00:07:04.250
or a formality.

126
00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.000
Knowing

127
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.750
that I

128
00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:11.208
am the root of all,

129
00:07:11.208 --> 00:07:15.916
and then letting this knowledge
settle in your heart –

130
00:07:15.916 --> 00:07:20.208
that is a thrilling journey.

131
00:07:20.208 --> 00:07:24.083
In a family where this understanding exists,

132
00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:29.250
worship of Me begins to happen naturally.

133
00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:34.500
Without any external pressure,
they all come together

134
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:38.041
to sing My praise.

135
00:07:38.041 --> 00:07:42.000
What a beautiful sight that is.

136
00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.416
In many families,

137
00:07:44.416 --> 00:07:47.541
a mother says, 'Light the lamp.'

138
00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:50.250
A father says, 'Recite the mantra,

139
00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.541
join the evening aarti.'

140
00:07:53.541 --> 00:07:58.791
Many such traditions continue.

141
00:07:58.791 --> 00:08:01.125
But why?

142
00:08:01.125 --> 00:08:05.000
What is the deeper meaning?

143
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:10.333
That explanation is often forgotten.

144
00:08:10.333 --> 00:08:11.875
Can such a ritual

145
00:08:11.875 --> 00:08:14.333
truly reach Me?

146
00:08:14.333 --> 00:08:17.458
When you speak to your children,

147
00:08:17.458 --> 00:08:19.958
your spouse, your parents

148
00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:23.500
about Me,

149
00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:26.458
tell them

150
00:08:26.458 --> 00:08:29.458
who I am,

151
00:08:29.458 --> 00:08:33.041
why I matter,

152
00:08:33.041 --> 00:08:35.666
and how

153
00:08:35.666 --> 00:08:41.625
I work in each person's life.

154
00:08:41.625 --> 00:08:43.708
Then see

155
00:08:43.708 --> 00:08:45.958
how their devotion

156
00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:48.291
truly blossoms.

157
00:08:48.291 --> 00:08:51.166
Can you imagine

158
00:08:51.166 --> 00:08:55.458
a family where every member knows

159
00:08:55.458 --> 00:09:00.000
why each part of worship matters?

160
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.250
How that family would shine

161
00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.083
with My light.

162
00:09:06.083 --> 00:09:09.583
When the music of knowledge plays,

163
00:09:09.583 --> 00:09:12.666
the sweet melody of My praise

164
00:09:12.666 --> 00:09:15.666
spreads through the whole home.

165
00:09:15.666 --> 00:09:18.083
And such a family

166
00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:20.875
becomes a living

167
00:09:20.875 --> 00:09:23.041
reflection of My divinity.

168
00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:28.791
Just as teaching

169
00:09:28.791 --> 00:09:32.875
young children requires both firmness

170
00:09:32.875 --> 00:09:37.250
and warmth –

171
00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:41.083
sometimes a firm word, sometimes a gentle one.

172
00:09:41.083 --> 00:09:43.291
In the same way, in the professional world

173
00:09:43.291 --> 00:09:45.416
too, sometimes intellect

174
00:09:45.416 --> 00:09:47.250
demands tough decisions,

175
00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:51.208
and then to ease those difficulties

176
00:09:51.208 --> 00:09:54.208
warmth too becomes necessary.

177
00:09:54.208 --> 00:09:56.291
You know,

178
00:09:56.291 --> 00:09:58.541
just as the wise

179
00:09:58.541 --> 00:10:02.750
know Me and worship Me with love,

180
00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.750
in the same way you too

181
00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:09.250
must use both reason

182
00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.833
and feeling in your work life.

183
00:10:12.833 --> 00:10:16.666
Does this thought not move you?

184
00:10:16.666 --> 00:10:17.958
With reason,

185
00:10:17.958 --> 00:10:21.083
you analyse situations,

186
00:10:21.083 --> 00:10:23.000
make good decisions.

187
00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.041
It is your power

188
00:10:25.041 --> 00:10:27.750
that identifies risks,

189
00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.541
builds plans,

190
00:10:29.541 --> 00:10:33.208
and finds solutions.

191
00:10:33.208 --> 00:10:35.083
But look,

192
00:10:35.083 --> 00:10:38.958
how does reason alone feel?

193
00:10:38.958 --> 00:10:42.625
A little cold, isn't it?

194
00:10:42.625 --> 00:10:47.708
Here, the warmth of feeling becomes essential.

195
00:10:47.708 --> 00:10:51.583
With feeling, you connect with others,

196
00:10:51.583 --> 00:10:53.833
understand their pain,

197
00:10:53.833 --> 00:10:57.583
and share in their enthusiasm.

198
00:10:57.583 --> 00:11:00.291
What a remarkable ability.

199
00:11:00.291 --> 00:11:04.250
A craftsman shaping a brass vessel

200
00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:08.541
strikes it with a hammer from outside,

201
00:11:08.541 --> 00:11:11.708
but also supports it

202
00:11:11.708 --> 00:11:15.500
with a block of wood from within.

203
00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:18.375
In the same way, the hammer of reason

204
00:11:18.375 --> 00:11:21.500
and the support of feeling

205
00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:23.291
together shape a work plan

206
00:11:23.291 --> 00:11:27.083
into something beautiful.

207
00:11:27.083 --> 00:11:28.250
Imagine

208
00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.625
you are working in an office.

209
00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:37.125
A challenging project lies before you.

210
00:11:37.125 --> 00:11:38.375
Your analysis

211
00:11:38.375 --> 00:11:43.666
tells you which path is more beneficial.

212
00:11:43.666 --> 00:11:45.500
And your sensitivity

213
00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:48.541
makes you think

214
00:11:48.541 --> 00:11:50.791
what effect this will have

215
00:11:50.791 --> 00:11:53.875
on the team members.

216
00:11:53.875 --> 00:11:56.166
Certainly in such moments,

217
00:11:56.166 --> 00:11:59.541
both together will give the best result.

218
00:11:59.541 --> 00:12:01.166
Think

219
00:12:01.166 --> 00:12:06.333
when you listen to your colleagues' concerns,

220
00:12:06.333 --> 00:12:10.083
you have two remarkable tools.

221
00:12:10.083 --> 00:12:14.000
Reason that finds solutions,

222
00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.166
and a heart that listens and understands.

223
00:12:18.166 --> 00:12:22.958
This balance is what makes a team strong.

224
00:12:22.958 --> 00:12:25.791
When you find this

225
00:12:25.791 --> 00:12:29.958
important balance, then your decisions

226
00:12:29.958 --> 00:12:33.458
are not only practical, but

227
00:12:33.458 --> 00:12:35.333
they also pave the way

228
00:12:35.333 --> 00:12:39.166
for everyone's wellbeing.

229
00:12:39.166 --> 00:12:42.750
How beautiful this thought is.

230
00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:47.333
This is the true practice of karma-yoga.

231
00:12:47.333 --> 00:12:51.250
The union of wisdom and compassion.

232
00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.416
Such karma-yogis

233
00:12:53.416 --> 00:12:57.375
are the ones who lift the world to greater heights.
